      "text": "For regulation 3.10, the following shall be substituted: '3.10 Setback Norms and Revised Table 8 (2026): Minimum front, rear, and side setbacks for residential and commercial plots up to 4,000 sq.m shall be governed by revised Table 8 effective 5 January 2026, eliminating side setbacks on plots up to 60 sq.m and rationalising percentage setbacks on plots up to 240 sq.m.'",
